  "definition": "Trust Agreements Qualified Under Ins 601.09",
  "effectiveDate": "2021-11-24",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ins 600) #6090, eff 9-7-95, EXPIRED: 9-7-03 New. #8240, eff 1-3-05; ss by #8827, eff 3-1-07; ss by #10449, eff 11-1-13 (from Ins 601.09); ss by #13296, eff 11-24-21 (formerly Ins 601.09)",
